# Canonical domain: force apex -> www so window.location.origin is always
# https://www.aakaarastudiosnyc.com. Board auth (Supabase invite/reset
# redirects) is allow-listed only for the www origin -- an editor landing on
# the bare apex domain would send a redirectTo Supabase can't match, and it
# silently falls back to the homepage instead of board/reset-password.html.
http://aakaarastudiosnyc.com/*    https://www.aakaarastudiosnyc.com/:splat   301!
https://aakaarastudiosnyc.com/*   https://www.aakaarastudiosnyc.com/:splat   301!

/the-experience.html   /couple-portraits.html   301
/couple-portraits      /couple-portraits.html   301
/index.html            /                        301
/admin/*              /admin/:splat            200
/tools/*              /tools/:splat            200
/board/*              /board/:splat            200
/films/:slug          /films/watch.html?v=:slug  200
/*                    /404.html                404
